# Read by `vite build`, which is what the Dockerfile runs.
#
# Relative on purpose. The deployed image serves the SPA and the API from one origin, so the
# bundle does not need to know its own hostname — which is what lets the same build run in a
# per-PR preview environment without being rebuilt for that preview's domain. axios joins this
# with the call sites ('/auth/login', '/RentalProperties') to give '/api/auth/login'.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
